#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:1
msgid "Do your first steps with Kdenlive video editor, using posterize effect"
msgstr "Dá os primeiros pasos co editor de vídeo Kdenlive co efecto de cartel."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, video editor, help, learn, easy, effects, filter, video "
"effects, stylize, posterize"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, editor de vídeo, axuda, aprender, fácil, efectos, filtro, "
"efectos de vídeo, estilizar, cartel"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:21
msgid "Posterize"
msgstr "Cartel"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:23
msgid ""
"This effect/filter posterizes\\ [1]_ the image by reducing the number of "
"colors used in the image."
msgstr ""
"Este efecto ou filtro dá un aspecto de cartel\\ [1]_ á imaxe reducindo o "
"número de cores que se usan na imaxe."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:25
msgid "The effect does not have keyframes."
msgstr "O efecto non ten fotogramas clave."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:33
msgid "Posterize effect"
msgstr "Efecto cartel"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:35
msgid "**Levels** - Number of values per channel"
msgstr "**Niveis**: número de valores por canle"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:40
msgid "**Notes**"
msgstr "**Notas**"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/posterize.rst:42
msgid ""
"For more details about posterization refer to the |posterization| article in "
"Wikipedia"
msgstr ""
"Para máis información sobre o efecto cartel consulta o artigo |"
"posterization| (en inglés) da Wikipedia."
